### ============================================================
### 7. PAYMENT (STRIPE INTEGRATION)
### ============================================================


### 7.1 Create Checkout Session (Customer Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/create
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "registrationId": "{{registrationId}}",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "usd",
  "successUrl": "http://localhost:3000/payment/success",
  "cancelUrl": "http://localhost:3000/payment/cancel"
}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK
#
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "sessionId": "cs_test_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
#     "checkoutUrl": "https://checkout.stripe.com/c/pay/cs_test_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX"
#   }
# }


### 7.2 Confirm Payment (Public / Stripe Webhook)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/confirm
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": "evt_1PXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "type": "checkout.session.completed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "cs_test_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
      "payment_status": "paid",
      "metadata": {
        "paymentId": "{{paymentId}}"
      }
    }
  }
}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK
#
# {
#   "received": true
# }


### 7.3 Get My Payment History (Customer Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK


### 7.4 Get Payment By ID (Customer Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK


### ============================================================
### 8. NOTIFICATIONS
### ============================================================


### 8.1 Get My Notifications (Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?isRead=false&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK


### 8.2 Get Unread Notification Count (Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK
#
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "unreadCount": 5
#   }
# }


### 8.3 Get Notification By ID (Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{announcementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK


### 8.4 Mark Notification As Read (Authenticated User)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{announcementId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK


### 8.5 Mark All Notifications As Read (Authenticated User)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK


### 8.6 Delete Notification (Authenticated User)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{announcementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK


### 8.7 Broadcast Notification To Club Members (ClubAdmin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/broadcast
Authorization: Bearer {{clubAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "clubId": "{{clubId}}",
  "title": "Workshop rescheduled",
  "message": "Saturday's workshop moved to Room 402, same time.",
  "type": "Announcement"
}

### Expected Response
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK
#
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Notification broadcasted successfully."
# }


